OL,3,ACan Burnham avoid another Labour
OL,4,Awelfare rebellion?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has committed to bringing
OL,7,Fthe welfare bill down, but he knows
OL,8,Fjust how the high the political stakes
OL,9,Fare.
OL,11,FHe saw how last year's welfare
OL,12,Frebellion marked the beginning of the
OL,13,Fend for his predecessor in Downing
OL,14,FStreet.
OL,16,FSir Keir Starmer's authority was
OL,17,Fshredded when 120 - more than a quarter
OL,18,F- of his own MPs threatened to derail
OL,19,Fhis reforms.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
