OL,3,ACan Burnham avoid another Labour
OL,4,Awelfare rebellion?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo defuse this, Sir Keir was compelled
OL,7,Fto guarantee that existing claimants of
OL,8,Fpersonal independence payment (Pip),
OL,9,Fthe main disability benefit in England
OL,10,Fand Wales, wouldn't lose out.
